=== (1) held body on the rotating Earth: generalized force on the exact trajectory ===
  Q.rhat * R^2/GMm = epsilon*u*cos(phi)*Subs(Derivative(W(_xi_1), _xi_1), _xi_1, u*Abs(cos(phi))/cos(phi))/Abs(cos(phi)) - epsilon*W(u*Abs(cos(phi))/cos(phi))*sin(phi)**2 - epsilon*W(u*Abs(cos(phi))/cos(phi))*cos(phi)**2 - sin(phi)**2 - cos(phi)**2
  [expected -(1 + eps (W(u) - u W'(u))) with u = Omega R cos(phi)/v*]
  Q.north * R^2/GMm = -epsilon*u*tan(phi)*Derivative(W(u), u)   [plumb-line tilt term]

